msgid ""
"Verify your API username and password are correct. Ensure you copied them "
"exactly from the Developer Portal without extra spaces. Check that you're "
"using the correct environment (Development vs Production)."
msgstr ""
"Verifica que tu nombre de usuario y contraseña de la API sean correctos. "
"Asegúrate de haberlos copiado exactamente del Portal del Desarrollador sin "
"espacios adicionales. Verifica que estés utilizando el entorno correcto "
"(Desarrollo vs Producción)."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.0/setup_instructions.html:484
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.1/setup_instructions.html:484
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.2/setup_instructions.html:484
msgid "Invalid Customer Number"
msgstr "Número de cliente inválido"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.0/setup_instructions.html:485
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.1/setup_instructions.html:485
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.2/setup_instructions.html:485
msgid ""
"The customer number must be exactly 10 digits. Remove any spaces, dashes, or "
"other characters. Verify the number with Canada Post if you're unsure."
msgstr ""
"El número de cliente debe tener exactamente 10 dígitos. Elimina cualquier "
"espacio, guion u otro carácter. Verifica el número con Canada Post si tienes "
"dudas."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.0/setup_instructions.html:489
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.1/setup_instructions.html:489
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.2/setup_instructions.html:489
msgid "No Rates Returned"
msgstr "No se devolvieron tarifas"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.0/setup_instructions.html:490
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.1/setup_instructions.html:490
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.2/setup_instructions.html:490
msgid ""
"Verify both origin and destination postal codes are valid. Ensure package "
"weight and dimensions are within Canada Post limits. Check that the service "
"is available for your selected route (domestic, USA, or international)."
msgstr ""
"Verifica que ambos códigos postales de origen y destino sean válidos. "
"Asegúrate de que el peso y las dimensiones del paquete estén dentro de los "
"límites de Canada Post. Verifica que el servicio esté disponible para la "
"ruta seleccionada (nacional, EE.UU. o internacional)."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.0/setup_instructions.html:494
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.1/setup_instructions.html:494
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.2/setup_instructions.html:494
msgid "Shipment Creation Failed"
msgstr "Creación del envío fallida"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.0/setup_instructions.html:495
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.1/setup_instructions.html:495
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.2/setup_instructions.html:495
msgid ""
"Ensure all required address fields are provided (name, street, city, "
"province, postal code). For international shipments, customs declarations "
"are required. Verify your customer type matches your credentials (Contract "
"vs Non-Contract)."
msgstr ""
"Asegúrate de que se proporcionen todos los campos obligatorios de la "
"dirección (nombre, calle, ciudad, provincia, código postal). Para envíos "
"internacionales, se requieren declaraciones aduaneras. Verifica que tu tipo "
"de cliente coincida con tus credenciales (Contrato vs No Contrato)."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.0/setup_instructions.html:499
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.1/setup_instructions.html:499
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.2/setup_instructions.html:499
msgid "XML Parse Error"
msgstr "Error de análisis XML"

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.0/setup_instructions.html:500
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.1/setup_instructions.html:500
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.2/setup_instructions.html:500
msgid ""
"Canada Post uses XML-based APIs. If you see XML errors, it may indicate "
"malformed request data. Check that special characters in addresses are "
"properly handled. Enable debug logging to see the full XML request and "
"response."
msgstr ""
"Canada Post utiliza APIs basadas en XML. Si ves errores de XML, puede "
"indicar que los datos de la solicitud están mal formados. Verifica que los "
"caracteres especiales en las direcciones se manejen correctamente. Activa el "
"registro de depuración para ver la solicitud y respuesta XML completas."

#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.0/setup_instructions.html:508
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.1/setup_instructions.html:508
#: components_data/integrations/shipping_provider/canadapost/v1.0.2/setup_instructions.html:508
